WEBVTT

00:39:59.788 --> 00:40:02.079
and even though we all like to think
of ourselves as good people,

00:40:02.454 --> 00:40:05.913
it took us a long time to figure
out the right structure,

00:40:06.204 --> 00:40:09.121
to figure out a charter that's
going to govern us and

00:40:09.121 --> 00:40:13.288
a set of incentives that we believe
will let us do our work.

00:40:13.288 --> 00:40:15.871
And kind of these we have these like
three elements that we talk about

00:40:15.871 --> 00:40:18.496
a lot research sort of engineering,

00:40:18.496 --> 00:40:20.788
development and deployment
policy and safety.

00:40:21.746 --> 00:40:27.079
Put those all together under a system
where you don't have to rely on.

00:40:28.954 --> 00:40:32.038
Anything but the natural
incentives to push in